🌷 **Allah par Imaan**

Allah par Imaan **4 cheezon** par mujtamil hai. Jo in par imaan rakhta hai, woh ek haqeeqi mumin hai.

---

💖 1. Allah ke **Wajood (Existence)** par Imaan

📖 Allah (swt) ne Surah Toor mein farmaya:
“*Aur kya woh kisi cheez se nahin banaye gaye the? Ya unhon ne apne aap ko bana liya?*” (At-Toor 52:35)

➡ Tafseer:

* Har cheez Allah ne banayi hai, kuch bhi apne aap paida nahi hua.
* Allah maujood hai, lekin insaan apni zindagi mein use nahi dekh sakta.

🌸 **Reflection**: Allah hi hamara Khaliq hai, humein har waqt uske wajood ka yaqeen rakhna chahiye.

---

💫 2. Allah ko **Rabb-ul-‘Alameen** maan’na

**Rabb = Khaliq + Maalik + Mudabbir**
* **Khaliq**: Paida karnewala
* **Maalik**: Har cheez ka maalik
* **Mudabbir**: Kaynaat ka intezam karnewala

👉 **Tawheed** = Imaan rakhna ke Allah ek hai.

📌 Kaise maloom hota hai ke Allah ek hai?

* Quran: *“Qul huwa Allahu Ahad”* (Ikhlas:1)
* Sab Nabiyon ne yeh bataya (Hud:50)
* Allah ko kisi madadgaar ki zarurat nahi hai
* Har cheez ek perfect order aur harmony mein hai

🌸 **Reflection**: Apne Rab ko waahid maano, uske saath shirk na karo.

---

🌹 3. Allah ke **Ma‘bood (Divinity)** hone par Imaan

* Sirf Allah ki ibadat karni chahiye.
* **Ilaah** = jiski mohabbat aur tazeem ke saath ibadat ki jaye.

📖 Qur’an:

* *“Maine jinnon aur insaanon ko isliye paida kiya ke woh sirf meri ibaadat karein.”* (Az-Zaariyat:56)
* Mushrikeen bhi Allah ko Rabb maante the, lekin shirk ki wajah se nafa nahi hua. (Zukhruf:87)
* *“Apne Rabb ki ibadat karo jisne tumhe aur tumse pehle logon ko paida kiya.”* (Al-Baqarah:21)
* Har Rasool ka paigham: *“Aye meri qaum! Allah ki ibaadat karo, uske siwa tumhara koi Ma‘bood nahi.”* (Al-A‘raaf:65)

🤲 **Ibadat ka matlab**:

* **Baatini**: Dil mein ibadat karna (ikhlas, tawakkul, mohabbat)
* **Zahiri**: Zaban aur amal se ibadat (zikr, Qur’an tilawat, dua, namaz, roza, hajj, qurbani, sadaqa, etc.)

📖 Hadith: Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya:
*“Beshak dua ibadat hai.”* Phir aapne tilawat ki:
*“Tumhara Rabb kehta hai: Mujhe pukaro, main tumhari dua qubool karunga.”* (Ghafir:60)

🌸 **Reflection**: Har ibadat sirf Allah ke liye ho, uske saath kisi ko shareek na karo.

---

🌙 4. Allah ke **Asma aur Sifaat (Names & Attributes)** par Imaan

Allah ke un sab naamon aur sifaat par imaan lana jo Qur’an aur Sunnah mein aaye hain.

📖 Qur’an:
*“Aur sabse khoobsurat naam sirf Allah ke hain, to apne Allah ko unhi naamon se pukaro.”* (Al-A‘raaf 7:180)

🔹 **Al-‘Aleem (All-Knowing)**
Allah sab kuch jaanta hai – hamare dil, soch, past aur future sab.

🔹 **Al-Baseer (All-Seeing)**
Allah sab kuch dekhta hai – achha, bura, khula, chhupa sab.

🔹 **As-Samee‘ (All-Hearing)**
Allah sab kuch sunta hai – awaaz, faryaad, hatta ke ek chinti ke qadam ki awaaz tak.

📖 Hadith: Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya:
*“Allah ke 99 naam hain, jo inko yaad karega woh Jannat mein dakhil hoga.”* (Muslim)

🌸 **Reflection**: Rozmarra zindagi mein Allah ke sifaat ko samajh kar use apni duaaon aur ibadat mein zikr karo.

---

✅ **Natija**:
Allah par imaan ka matlab sirf uske wajood ko maan’na nahi, balki usse Rabb, Ma‘bood, aur uske Asma wa Sifaat ko qubool karna hai. Jo yeh 4 points samajhkar amal kare, woh haqeeqi mumin hai.

